  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## GET /metrics — Prometheus exposition format

  Returns all registered metrics in Prometheus text format (`text/plain; version=0.0.4`).

  Key metric families:
  - `http_requests_total` — request count by method/path/status (prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator)
  - `http_request_duration_seconds` — latency histogram
  - `pipeline_observations_created_total{endpoint}` — observation inserts by endpoint
  - `pipeline_batch_insert_size` — batch sizes histogram
  - `pipeline_llm_prompt_tokens_total{model,endpoint}` — LLM token usage
  - `pipeline_observations_upsert_conflicts_total{mode}` — upsert conflict rate
  - `pipeline_circuit_breaker_state{circuit}` — 0=CLOSED, 1=OPEN, 2=HALF_OPEN
  - `pipeline_job_executions_total{job,status}` — scheduler job outcomes
  - `pipeline_job_duration_seconds{job}` — scheduler job latency

  Scraped by Prometheus every 15 s (see `infra/` docker-compose config).
}
